+{"connection_id":"BC-a7c2c9c580d8df7783b7","ref":"WLC:Ps.40.3","status":"rejected","reason":"Feet are set on rock after a muddy pit and steps made firm, but the image lacks a straight road or helper's hand; Psalm 94:18 voices support at failed footing.","paragraphs":[],"evidence":["WLC:Ps.40.3"],"annotations":[]}
+{"connection_id":"BC-bf591068d15785a7bede","ref":"WLC:Ps.66.9","status":"rejected","reason":"The community's feet are kept from slipping, but the verse does not describe requesting support; Psalm 94:18 does.","paragraphs":[],"evidence":["WLC:Ps.66.9"],"annotations":[]}
